  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Studie f&#xf6;r IKT-plattform f&#xf6;r invandrarf&#xf6;retagande</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study ICT-support to emigrants business ventures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet inneb&#xe4;r att genomf&#xf6;ra en studie som tar fram l&#xe4;mpligt       inneh&#xe5;ll och teknik f&#xf6;r en ICT-plattform (Diaspora Link). Plattformen skall fungera som en l&#xe4;nk mellan entrepren&#xf6;rer i hemlandet och i      diasporan. Studien genomf&#xf6;rs av Stockholms                            Universitet/DSV-institutionen. Intentionen &#xe4;r att i studien utveckla  en ICT-plattform f&#xf6;r migrationskorridoren mellan Sverige och</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project concerns a study on content and technology for an        ICT-platform &quot;Diaspora Link&quot; a &quot;Network for Transnational Diaspora    Entrepreneurship as a Development Link between Home and Residence     Countries. The study is made by Stockholm university/DSV. The         intention is to develop the ICT-platform for the migration corridor   Ethiopia/Sweden.</narrative>
  </description>
